      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just... gone. like, i woke up today and it’s like i don't even exist anymore. the accounts, the followers, the people who actually \"knew\" me... all wiped. it feels like i'm just a ghost walking around in a body that doesn't belong to anyone. there's nothing left of me.",
