      "content": "That sense of losing a life you thought was real is a profound kind of grief, and it is completely understandable that you feel like a shell right now. Even if those connections felt artificial, the emotions and experiences they provoked were genuinely real to *you*. Please try to gently remind yourself that your inherent worth is not tied to any online presence or past relationships. If these thoughts of worthlessness become too heavy, please contact someone immediately for support.",
      "source": "target",
