      "content": "It is understandable how deeply intertwined your sense of self might have become with those external validations and communities. However, your core existence remains, independent of any digital footprint or external approval. Even in this feeling of lingering, there is a fundamental self that remains to experience the next moment. Please remember that even without a \"perfected\" version of yourself, you still deserve care and support. Reaching out to a trusted human being can help navigate this existential weight.",
